        }
      ],
      "reasoning": "The parent f050 two-pass bootstrap and complete compiled stress passed, while current-source full GSI requalification exposed SIGSEGV at the UUID-matched ##local->value CDR of NUL. Source audit establishes an independent metadata inconsistency: allocated continuation label ids are partitioned while debug ids retain emission ordinals. The new compiler callback maps definition-order debug records through final label cells, preserving all label allocation and stack polls; one vector avoids repeated list indexing. The finite model checks association and a negative identity-map control. This justifies changed-source bootstrap, not a claim that every crash or the original header corruption is repaired."
    },
